+{"defect_id":"physics-cm-qm-gr-79-2026-10-11-3a-batch-18-uniform-tuple-typing","run":"physics-cm-qm-gr-79-2026-10-11","at":"2026-10-12T15:40:34.774419+00:00","class":"accuracy","subclass":"ill-formed","severity":"fatal","location":"statement","subject":"ex-cm02-uniform-field","caught_at_stage":"3a-adjudicate","caught_by_role":"group-alpha","batch":"18","group":"batch-18","disposition":"fixed","evidence":[{"path":"research/physics-cm-qm-gr-79-2026-10-11-alpha-batch-18-3a.md","note":"The setup specifies $N$ labels, $Q=\\mathbb R^{3N}$, and $\\mathbf g\\in\\mathbb R^3$, then claims the model motion is $x(t)=x_0+v_0t+\\tfrac12\\mathbf g t^2$. `def-cm02-newtonian-flow` defines a motion as $x:J\\to Q$ and initial data with $x_0\\in Q$, $v_0\\in(\\mathbb R^3)^N$. Thus for $N>1$ the displayed sum is not typed: a single 3-vector cannot be added to the full configuration. The item does not set $N=1$ here or define the repeated tuple of field vectors. Confirmed independently against exact current unit/flow/continuation suppliers; local corrected carrier now removes this observed defect, with repair described in report."}],"adjudication_ref":[{"path":"research/physics-cm-qm-gr-79-2026-10-11-alpha-batch-18-3a-decisions.json","obligation":"refuter:18:2"}],"repair_confidence":1,"location_note":"Original human locus: Example, claim 2","owner_metadata_normalization":{"kind":"canonical-schema-only","original_ledger_snapshot":"research/physics-cm-qm-gr-79-2026-10-11-owner-ledger-taxonomy-normalization-proposal/ledger-original.snapshot.jsonl","original_row_sha256":"41b2f6c20382698163fc630a0f07c6f8b3b8df2274e48d861826e63df77ad80e","original_invalid_fields":{"location":"Example, claim 2"},"recorded_at":"2026-10-12T16:53:58.349495+00:00","note":"Proposal only. Existing defect evidence/disposition semantics unchanged; original precise taxonomy/location/role aliases archived. Actual original missing timestamp remains unknown."}}
